  "projectName": "CodeLoom Engine",
  "projectDescription": "A headless AI coding agent backend that exposes a newline-delimited JSON protocol over a Unix domain socket, enabling any client to drive a multi-personality LLM orchestrator with 64 tools for reading, searching, and editing code.",
