  "keyFeatures": [
    "Headless AI coding agent backend with NDJSON-over-Unix-socket protocol",
    "Multi-personality orchestrator with 6 built-in subagent profiles (ask, coder, tester, researcher, debugger, reviewer)",
    "64 tools spanning file navigation, tree-sitter AST queries, LSP integration, shell execution, git, GitHub, web, and MCP",
    "Paranoid write funnel with read-before-edit enforcement, path guard, syntax gate (tree-sitter), atomic writes, and journal-based undo",
    "Context compaction with cascading trim/summarize/truncate/drop strategy to stay within LLM context budgets",
    "Git worktree isolation for writer agents with merge/PR/keep/discard settle flow",
    "Structured long-term memory (files, engineering, product, CI/CD, other) persisted to .engine/memory.json",
    "MCP server integration with auth flow, backoff/reconnect, and profile-scoped tool allowlists",
    "Skills system with SKILL.md discovery, progressive disclosure, and lexical ranking",
    "Prometheus metrics with Pushgateway support and A/B benchmark harness"
  ],
